# Build a Production-Ready Gift Guide CMS for Fourthwall

## 1. Your Role and Objective

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, product designer, and application architect. Build a complete, functional web application in Google AI Studio.

The application is a reusable, cloud-backed **Gift Guide CMS and HTML Template Engine** for my Fourthwall shop, Science of Gifts.

My Fourthwall pages have limited layout customization options. I have already designed a sophisticated editorial-style gift guide using custom HTML and CSS. The CSS is installed in the site's header and is already working. I do not want to rebuild, redesign, or modify that CSS.

The purpose of this application is to generate, manage, preview, and export the HTML content that goes inside separate custom-code blocks on Fourthwall pages.

I will reuse this application for many different gift-guide topics, including Greek mythology, history, historical eras, and other interest-based gift guides.

**This must be a working application, not a static mockup or a prototype with nonfunctional buttons.** Build the actual data persistence, editing, AI generation, HTML rendering, export, and schema generation functionality.

Before writing code, inspect the provided reference materials and the existing project. If this is an existing application, preserve its working functionality and integrate the new functionality rather than replacing unrelated code.

